, 10 INV refs, **anti-laziness**. Adversarial craft tool compliance enforcer.\\n5. **romantic-fantasy-writer-drafting-auditor** (A-049) — 908 words, 17 INV refs, **anti-laziness**, **pass/fail rubric**. Adversarial phase gate for drafting.\\n\\n### Revision Phase (5 agents)\\n6. **romantic-fantasy-writer-developmental-editor** (A-050) — 700 words, 12 INV refs. Big-picture structural editor.\\n7. **romantic-fantasy-writer-line-editor** (A-051) — 703 words, 12 INV refs. Sentence-level prose quality editor.\\n8. **romantic-fantasy-writer-copy-editor** (A-052) — 621 words, 8 INV refs. Factual accuracy and consistency editor.\\n9. **romantic-fantasy-writer-chapter-reviser** (A-053) — 649 words, 6 INV refs. Revision executor implementing editorial direction.\\n10. **romantic-fantasy-writer-revision-auditor** (A-054) — 799 words, 7 INV refs, **anti-laziness**, **pass/fail rubric**. Adversarial phase gate for revision.\\n\\n### Beta Reading Phase (7 agents)\\n11. **romantic-fantasy-writer-romance-beta-reader** (A-055) — 755 words, 8 INV refs. Romance lens: chemistry, pacing, vulnerability.\\n12. **romantic-fantasy-writer-fantasy-beta-reader** (A-056) — 651 words, 8 INV refs. Fantasy lens: worldbuilding, magic, immersion.\\n13. **romantic-fantasy-writer-craft-beta-reader** (A-057) — 599 words, 10 INV refs. Craft lens: structure, foreshadowing, motifs.\\n14. **romantic-fantasy-writer-sensitivity-beta-reader** (A-058) — 668 words, 4 INV refs. Sensitivity lens: representation, power dynamics, consent.\\n15. **romantic-fantasy-writer-originality-beta-reader** (A-059) — 678 words, 4 INV refs. Originality lens: plagiarism, derivative content.\\n16. **romantic-fantasy-writer-beta-synthesizer** (A-060) — 657 words, 4 INV refs. Aggregates all 5 lens findings into prioritized revision mandate.\\n17. **romantic-fantasy-writer-beta-reading-auditor** (A-061) — 764 words, 5 INV refs, **anti-laziness**, **pass/fail rubric**. Adversarial phase gate for beta reading.\\n\\n### Polish Phase (3