e-backed entries — not just note \\\"motif present.\\\"\\n4. **Revision traceability chain**: The chapter-reviser, revision-auditor, and beta-synthesizer form a tight traceability chain where every change cites a finding ID and every claimed fix is verified.\\n5. **Cross-cutting agents as orchestrator-level**: The continuity-tracker, series-kb-manager, and craft-tracker report to the top-level orchestrator (not a coordinator) because they span multiple pipeline phases.\\n\\n## Not Touched (by design)\\n\\n- 20 routing agents (coordinators/orchestrator/guide) — status \\\"reviewed\\\", already approved\\n- 24 previously-rewritten specialists — already have 300+ words of domain-specific content\\n\", \"path\": \"/home/jakubs/repositories/ralph-orchestrator/.fractal-factory/agents/fractal-factory-prompt-writer/output.md\"}"
