al throughlines, motifs.\\n\\n## Quality Metrics\\n\\n| Metric | Value |\\n|--------|-------|\\n| Total agents written | 23 |\\n| Word count range | 516-908 words |\\n| Average word count | 678 words |\\n| Anti-laziness agents | 5 |\\n| Pass/fail rubric agents | 3 |\\n| Agents with Unknown invariants | 0 |\\n| Agents with generic descriptions | 0 |\\n| All meeting 400+ word requirement | 23/23 |\\n\\n## Not Touched (by design)\\n\\n- 20 routing agents (status: reviewed) — already approved\\n- 24 previously-rewritten specialists — already have 300+ words of domain content\\n'''\\n\\nwith open('.fractal-factory/agents/fractal-factory-prompt-writer/output.md', 'w') as f:\\n    f.write(content)\\nprint(f'output.md written: {len(content)} chars')\\n\\\"\\n\", \"description\": \"Write output.md\", \"shellId\": \"out1\"}"
