strator, and the guide. Their prompts were approved in a prior pass.\n- **24 previously-rewritten specialists NOT touched**: These already had 300+ words of domain-specific content from the first part of iteration 2 before the crash.\n</technical_details>\n\n<important_files>\n- `.fractal-factory/roster.json`\n   - Master roster of all ~67 agents in the romantic-fantasy-writer family\n   - Updated: set status=\"written\" for the 23 target agents\n   - Key fields per agent: id, name, level, parent, reads, writes, resultCodes, antiLaziness, status\n\n- `.fractal-factory/domain-model.json`\n   - Contains all 81 invariants (INV-001 through INV-081) that must be mapped to agents\n   - Also contains subdomain definitions\n   - Read-only — not modified\n\n- `.fractal-factory/architecture.json`\n   - Artifact schemas for all domain artifacts (chapters, beta-feedback, revision-reports, audit-reports, trackers, delivery-report, series-kb)\n   - Contains dataFlow definitions showing artifact handoff between agents\n   - Read-only — not modified\n\n- `.fractal-factory/output/romantic-fantasy-writer/agents/` (directory)\n   - Contains all ~67 agent prompt files (.agent.md)\n   - 23 files were overwritten with full domain-specific content\n   - Each file: 516-908 words, unique role description, mapped INV invariants, step-by-step process\n\n- `.fractal-factory/agents/fractal-factory-prompt-writer/status.json`\n   - Status contract for this prompt-writer execution\n   - Written: result=\"written\", iteration=2, status=\"completed\"\n\n- `.fractal-factory/agents/fractal-factory-prompt-writer/output.md`\n   - Narrative summary of iteration 2 work\n   - Lists all 23 agents with word counts, INV ref counts, and special attributes\n\n- `.fractal-factory/manifest.json`\n   - Pipeline-wide manifest tracking all agent executions\n   - Prepended with new entry (now 16 entries total)\n\n- `.fractal-factory/context.json`\n   - Pipeline context: domain name \"fantasy-writer\", naming prefix \