| 39 | series-kb-manager | approved | 635 | 6 | 6 | Cross-book continuity |\\n| 40 | structure-selector | approved | 425 | 6 | 7 | Framework selection |\\n| 41 | style-analyzer | approved | 398 | 4 | 6 | Below 400w - conditional logic |\\n| 42 | style-auditor | approved | 543 | 10 | 6 | Auditor w/ pass/fail + anti-laziness |\\n| 43 | style-guide-writer | approved | 457 | 8 | 7 | Prose standard definition |\\n| 44 | summary-generator | approved | 516 | 6 | 7 | Series KB feeder |\\n| 45 | supporting-cast-developer | approved | 444 | 6 | 6 | Antagonist/ensemble |\\n| 46 | tension-mapper | approved | 361 | 3 | 6 | Below 400w - narrow scope |\\n| 47 | worldbuilding-auditor | approved | 693 | 11 | 7 | Auditor w/ pass/fail + anti-laziness |\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Warnings (non-blocking)\\n\\n### WARN-1: Guide has ask_questions suppression despite being user-facing\\n\\n- **Agent:** guide\\n- **Location:** Line 12\\n- **Evidence:** \\\"You must never use ask_questions or request human input\\\" but User Interaction Protocol (Phases B-E) explicitly instructs gathering user input.\\n- **Impact:** Low. The User Interaction Protocol clearly overrides this. The suppression refers to the ask_questions tool, not conversational interaction. Per the original spec, the guide is exempt from this suppression.\\n- **Recommendation:** Remove line 12 from the guide in a future polish pass.\\n\\n### WARN-2: Four agents below 400-word threshold\\n\\n- **Agents:** tension-mapper (361w), political-structure-builder (365w), dual-arc-builder (384w), style-analyzer (398w)\\n- **Impact:** Low. All 4 have complete actionable content with 6 detailed process steps each, correct invariant mappings, and clear artifact assignments. Lower word counts reflect narrower scope.\\n- **Recommendation:** Accept as-is. Word count is a heuristic, not a hard rule.\\n\\n### WARN-3: No YAML frontmatter across all agents\\n\\n- **Agents:** All 47\\n- **Evidence:** Files use bold-text metadata header format instead of YAML