uity-tracker**: 6 INVs, 7 steps. Timeline, positions, knowledge states, naming tracked.\\n12. **copy-editor**: 8 INVs, 6 steps. World rule compliance and naming consistency checks specific.\\n13. **craft-beta-reader**: 10 INVs, 5 steps. Reading Lens Protocol correctly scopes craft evaluation.\\n14. **craft-enforcer**: 10 INVs, 5 steps, anti-laziness (5 rules). Tool-by-tool, scene-by-scene verification.\\n15. **craft-profile-selector**: 31 INVs (covers T1-T26), 6 steps. Available Craft Tools section provides reference.\\n16. **craft-tracker**: 7 INVs, 6 steps, anti-laziness (5 rules). Four tracking artifacts clearly specified.\\n17. **culture-builder**: 5 INVs, 6 steps. Romance-relevant social norms connection well made.\\n18. **delivery-assembler**: 7 INVs, 7 steps. Complete final assembly with quality metrics.\\n19. **developmental-editor**: 12 INVs, 8 steps. Dual-arc interleave and pacing focus appropriate.\\n20. **drafting-auditor**: 17 INVs, 7 steps, anti-laziness (\\\"15 observations\\\" minimum), pass/fail (9+9 criteria). Most comprehensive auditor.\\n21. **dual-arc-builder**: 4 INVs, 6 steps. Black moment convergence (INV-045) well specified. 384w but actionable.\\n22. **fantasy-beta-reader**: 8 INVs, 6 steps. Worldbuilding immersion and magic compliance focus appropriate.\\n23. **geography-builder**: 5 INVs, 6 steps. Romantically and tactically significant locations show dual-purpose design.\\n24. **guide**: 8 INVs, 7 phases. User Interaction Protocol comprehensive. See WARN-1.\\n25. **history-builder**: 6 INVs, 6 steps. Foreshadowing hooks and prophecy design serve narrative.\\n26. **line-editor**: 12 INVs, 7 steps. MRU structure (INV-052/T14) and micro-tension (INV-035) checks specific.\\n27. **magic-system-designer**: 5 INVs, 6 steps. Sanderson's Laws (INV-048/T10) and romantic intersections.\\n28. **originality-beta-reader**: 4 INVs, 6 steps. Zero-tolerance plagiarism mandate and transformative influence (INV-024).\\n29. **plotting-auditor**: 10 INVs, 8 steps, anti-laziness, pass/fail (7+5 criteria). Foreshadowing tracing specific.\\n30. **polisher**: 5 INVs, 6 steps. Read-aloud pass and emotional landing point verification.\\n31. **political-structure-builder**: 4 INVs, 6 steps. Faction design and antagonist position (INV-022). 365w but actionable.\\n32. **pov-voice-maintainer**: 7 INVs, 7 steps. Voice fingerprint audit and recognition test (INV-034) measurable.\\n33. **protagonist-profiler**: 7 INVs, 7 steps. Psychological profiling (wound/desire/fear/lie/ghost/need) exemplary.\\n34. **revision-auditor**: 7 INVs, 7 steps, anti-laziness, pass/fail (6+6 criteria). Finding Verification Matrix rigorous.\\n35. **romance-arc-designer**: 7 INVs, 7 steps. Vulnerability Escalation Ladder (INV-059) and dual-arc mapping.\\n36. **romance-beta-reader**: 8 INVs, 6 steps. Chemistry, agency balance, and heat level checks specific.\\n37. **scene-beat-designer**: 5 INVs, 6 steps. Value shifts (INV-040), five commandments (INV-041), scene-sequel (INV-039).\\n38. **sensitivity-beta-reader**: 4 INVs, 6 steps. Power dynamics, consent, and harmful trope focus appropriate.\\n39. **series-kb-manager**: 6 INVs, 6 steps. Fact promotion workflow and sequel briefing generation.\\n40. **structure-selector**: 6 INVs, 7 steps. Framework selection and stakes escalation (INV-044).\\n41. **style-analyzer**: 4 INVs, 6 steps. Abstract pattern extraction (INV-023) with conditional branching. 398w.\\n42. **style-auditor**: 10 INVs, 6 steps, anti-laziness, pass/fail (6+5 criteria). \\\"Mental example\\\" testing approach.\\n43. **style-guide-writer**: 8 INVs, 7 steps. Per-character voice calibration and quality floor definition.\\n44. **summary-generator**: 6 INVs, 7 steps. Dual-purpose summaries (downstream agents + series KB).\\n45. **supporting-cast-developer**: 6 INVs, 6 steps. Antagonist (INV-022), mentors, thematic foils.\\n46. **tension-mapper**: 3 INVs, 6 steps. Pacing problem identification and prescription. 361w, narrow scope.\\n47. **worldbuilding-auditor**: 11 INVs, 7 steps, anti-laziness (\\\"second pass\\\" requirement), pass/fail (6+6 criteria).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Cross-Cutting Quality Observations\\n\\n1. **Invariant coverage**: 72 of 81 invariants referenced across the 47 agents. The remaining 9 are likely covered by the 20 routing agents or are meta-level pipeline invariants.\\n\\n2. **Artifact flow is coherent**: Reads/Writes across agents form a complete data flow. No orphaned artifacts visible.\\n\\n3. **Auditor architecture is sound**: Every creative phase has a dedicated adversarial auditor with anti-laziness rules and pass/fail gates.\\n\\n4. **Beta reading design is sophisticated**: 5 independent lenses + 1 synthesizer + 1 auditor = 7 agents with scoped evaluation domains.\\n\\n5. **Craft tool enforcement**: craft-profile-selector to craft-enforcer to craft-tracker pipeline ensures selected tools are binding (INV-079).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Conclusion\\n\\n**All 47 specialist/guide agents pass iteration 2 review.** The prompt-writer has comprehensively addressed all 5 blocking issues from iteration 1. The rewritten agents are domain-specific, well-structured, actionable, and appropriately scoped. The 5 warnings are non-blocking observations for future refinement. The pipeline is ready to proceed to infrastructure writing.\\n\"}"
