```json
{
  "agent": "fractal-factory-infra-writer",
  "task_id": "pass4/infra-writing",
  "status": "completed",
  "result": "infrastructure-written",
  "summary": "...",
  "artifacts": ["agents/fractal-factory-infra-writer/status.json", "agents/fractal-factory-infra-writer/output.md"],
  "next_hint": null,
  "iteration": 1
}
```

Also write your output.md with details of what infrastructure was created.
