              "arguments": "{\"file_text\": \"# MCP Sidecar\\n\\n**Reusability**: adaptable — adapt if the romantic-fantasy-writer system needs MCP tool servers.\\n\\n## Purpose\\n\\nSidecar pattern for providing MCP tool servers to agent containers.\\n\\n## Adaptation Notes\\n\\nFor the romantic-fantasy-writer system:\\n1. Primary tools needed: filesystem read/write for artifact management\\n2. Optional: web-fetch for style sample retrieval (if URL-based samples supported)\\n3. No database or API servers needed — pure filesystem artifact system\\n\\n## Referenced By\\n\\n- Infrastructure deployment (optional)\\n\", \"path\": \"/home/jakubs/repositories/ralph-orchestrator/.fractal-factory/output/romantic-fantasy-writer/skills/mcp-sidecar/SKILL.md\"}"
